# Copy to .env and fill in for your setup. EXPO_PUBLIC_-prefixed vars are
# inlined into the app bundle at build time (same idea as movie-frontend's
# VITE_ prefix).
#
# Required for a physical device (Expo Go on your phone) — "localhost" on a
# phone means the phone itself, not your computer, so you need your
# computer's LAN IP instead. Find it with `ipconfig` (Windows) and look for
# your Wi-Fi adapter's IPv4 address. Your phone and computer must be on the
# same network.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.20:3000/api
#
# Not needed for the Android emulator or iOS simulator — mobile/src/api/client.ts
# already defaults to 10.0.2.2 (Android emulator -> host) / localhost (iOS
# simulator shares the host network) when this is unset.

# Optional — defaults to Google's public reCAPTCHA v2 test key (always
# passes). Set this to the same value as movie-frontend's
# VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY for anything beyond local dev.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
